 sequence positions can be learned and used for prediction or classification. Within Natural Language Processing, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of sequence modelling within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the Natural Language Processing module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of sequence modelling, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'sequence modelling; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of sequence modelling, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Artificial Intelligence', 'Active'), ('KCR_000154', 'parsing', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Technical Concept', 'Analysing the grammatical or structural organisation of a sentence or other language sequence.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of parsing within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the Natural Language Processing module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of parsing, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Analysing the grammatical or structural organisation of a sentence or other language sequence. Within Natural Language Processing, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of parsing within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the Natural Language Processing module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of parsing, its governing relationships or mechanisms, app