stem architecture within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the AI Systems, Safety and Ethics module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of AI system architecture, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'AI system architecture; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of AI system architecture, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Artificial Intelligence', 'Active'), ('KCR_000163', 'robustness', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Technical Concept', 'The ability of an AI system to maintain acceptable performance under disturbances, uncertainty, or input variation.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of robustness within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the AI Systems, Safety and Ethics module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of robustness, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'The ability of an AI system to maintain acceptable performance under disturbances, uncertainty, or input variation. Within AI Systems, Safety and Ethics, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of robustness within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the AI Systems, Safety and Ethics module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of robustness, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'robustness; Core considerations include the defining c