pt covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of privacy within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the AI Systems, Safety and Ethics module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of privacy, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'privacy; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of privacy, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Artificial Intelligence', 'Active'), ('KCR_000167', 'safety and governance', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Technical Concept', 'safety and governance in Artificial Intelligence concerns legal rules, institutional mechanisms, duties, procedures, and compliance considerations governing safety and governance.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of safety and governance within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the AI Systems, Safety and Ethics module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of safety and governance, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'safety and governance in Artificial Intelligence concerns legal rules, institutional mechanisms, duties, procedures, and compliance considerations governing safety and governance. Within AI Systems, Safety and Ethics, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of safety and governance within Artificial Intelligence, particularly where the AI Systems, Safety and Ethics module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of safety and governance, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'safety and governance; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of safety and governance, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Artificial Intelligence', 'Active'), ('KCR_000168', 'supervised learning', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Machine Learning', 'Technical Concept', 'Supervised learning learns a mapping from inputs to labelled outputs using observed training examples.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of supervised learning within Machine Learning, particularly where the Learning Paradigms module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of supervised learning, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Supervised learning learns a mapping from inputs to labelled outputs using observed training examples. Within Learning Paradigms, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of supervised learning within Machine Learning, particularly where the Learning Paradigms module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of supervised learning, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'supervised learning; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of supervised learning, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Machine Learning', 'Active'), ('KCR_000169', 'unsupervised learning', 'Engineering & Tec