, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of self-supervised learning within Machine Learning, particularly where the Learning Paradigms module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of self-supervised learning, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'self-supervised learning; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of self-supervised learning, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Machine Learning', 'Active'), ('KCR_000172', 'reinforcement learning', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Machine Learning', 'Technical Concept', 'Reinforcement learning models sequential decision making in which an agent learns a policy from interactions with an environment and feedback in the form of rewards or costs.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of reinforcement learning within Machine Learning, particularly where the Learning Paradigms module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of reinforcement learning, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Reinforcement learning models sequential decision making in which an agent learns a policy from interactions with an environment and feedback in the form of rewards or costs. Within Learning Paradigms, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of reinforcement learning within Machine Learning, particularly where the Learning Paradigms module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristi